<rss xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom" xmlns:content="http://purl.org/rss/1.0/modules/content/" version="2.0"><channel><title>One Useful Thing Newsletter</title><link>https://rss.longlone.de5.net/own/kaG7X8yt97QF2OsjZ7EePTenAdZzZrdS.xml</link><description>Messages from sources matching oneusefulthing@substack.com</description><lastBuildDate>Thu, 04 Jun 2026 21:36:04 GMT</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://rss.longlone.de5.net/own/kaG7X8yt97QF2OsjZ7EePTenAdZzZrdS.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"></atom:link><item><title>Co-Existence and the End of Co-Intelligence</title><link>https://rss.longlone.de5.net/own/kaG7X8yt97QF2OsjZ7EePTenAdZzZrdS.xml#item-156</link><guid isPermaLink="false">own-newsletter:item:156</guid><pubDate>Thu, 04 Jun 2026 21:13:42 GMT</pubDate><author>Ethan Mollick from One Useful Thing &lt;oneusefulthing@substack.com&gt;</author><description>Co-Existence and the End of Co-IntelligenceAlso: how pitch a book to an AI!͏ ­͏ ­͏ ­͏ ­͏ ­͏ ­͏ ­͏ ­͏ ­͏ ­͏ ­͏ ­͏ ­͏ ­͏ ­͏ ­͏ ­͏ ­͏ ­͏ ­͏ ­͏ ­͏ ­͏ ­͏ ­͏ ­͏ ­͏ ­͏ ­͏ ­͏ ­͏ ­͏ ­͏ ­͏ ­͏ ­͏ ­͏ ­͏ ­͏ ­͏ ­͏ ­͏ ­͏ ­͏ ­͏ ­͏ ­͏ ­͏ ­͏ ­͏ ­͏ ­͏ ­͏ ­͏ ­͏ ­͏ ­͏ ­͏ ­͏ ­͏ ­͏ ­͏ ­͏ ­͏ ­͏ ­͏ ­͏...</description><content:encoded>Co-Existence and the End of Co-Intelligence&lt;img src="https://eotrx.substackcdn.com/o/907a47ebb324c3a2/p.gif?.A5JaBTXvdHCxwkgngEJfzOHNWCrS1A68dDF-UOIZ5XQ" alt="" width="1" height="1"&gt;Also: how pitch a book to an AI!͏ &amp;nbsp;   ­͏ &amp;nbsp;   ­͏ &amp;nbsp;   ­͏ &amp;nbsp;   ­͏ &amp;nbsp;   ­͏ &amp;nbsp;   ­͏ &amp;nbsp;   ­͏ &amp;nbsp;   ­͏ &amp;nbsp;   ­͏ &amp;nbsp;   ­͏ &amp;nbsp;   ­͏ &amp;nbsp;   ­͏ &amp;nbsp;   ­͏ &amp;nbsp;   ­͏ &amp;nbsp;   ­͏ &amp;nbsp;   ­͏ &amp;nbsp;   ­͏ &amp;nbsp;   ­͏ &amp;nbsp;   ­͏ &amp;nbsp;   ­͏ &amp;nbsp;   ­͏ &amp;nbsp;   ­͏ &amp;nbsp;   ­͏ &amp;nbsp;   ­͏ &amp;nbsp;   ­͏ &amp;nbsp;   ­͏ &amp;nbsp;   ­͏ &amp;nbsp;   ­͏ &amp;nbsp;   ­͏ &amp;nbsp;   ­͏ &amp;nbsp;   ­͏ &amp;nbsp;   ­͏ &amp;nbsp;   ­͏ &amp;nbsp;   ­͏ &amp;nbsp;   ­͏ &amp;nbsp;   ­